00:05:23.222 --> 00:05:24.691
If the Western community

00:05:24.691 --> 00:05:26.926
doesn't really start to do more here

00:05:26.926 --> 00:05:29.095
and take these take these issues

00:05:29.095 --> 00:05:30.096
